-- ============================================================================
-- V12 -- Expand city reference data
--
-- V3 seeded a deliberately small, curated shortlist (~5-8 cities per state,
-- ~195 total). Lawyer registration's city picker is bounded by whatever is in
-- this table, so a lawyer outside those handful of cities per state had
-- nowhere to register from - reported as "not showing all the cities of
-- India". This migration adds several hundred more well-known Indian cities
-- and towns, state by state, using the same pattern as V3's seed block.
--
-- ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING against uq_cities_state_name: several of these may
-- already exist from V3, and re-running the same city for a state must be a
-- no-op rather than a failed migration.
-- ============================================================================

ON CONFLICT (state_id, name_normalized) DO NOTHING;
